{"id":"vod_sn_38611","vodId":"38611","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恋爱暴君","name_cn":"恋爱暴君","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/651d96ca0b2e989e5fe2db18ae61d55e.jpg"},"summary":"蓝野青司（小野贤章 配音）是一个随处可见的平凡高中男生，某日，他遇见了名为古莉（青山吉能 配音）的少女，竟然因此被卷入了充满了粉红色气息的恋爱风波中去。原来，古莉的真身是魔王的女儿，拥有一本法力强大的“亲吻笔记”，名字被写在笔记上的人，必须在二十四小时内同他人接吻，不然古莉便会死去。　　在误打误撞之中，古莉将青司的名字写在了笔记本上，这也就意味着，如果无法接吻，青司将面临着“一辈子单身”的悲惨命运。外表单纯内里腹黑的绯山茜（沼仓爱美 配音）、傲娇活泼的空手道少女蓝野亚久亚（高桥李依 配音）、拥有着超强毅力的黄蝶崎柚（长野佑纪 配音），究竟是谁能够帮助青司走出困境？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8fxTvZL4q21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dj3wQuysac1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZDaG7n8ybA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qTxkxu3XyN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uJ5zPN7mXJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TfuDd9asCC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hgfpjxceXX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y90mvyZG1a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6kH6R2FvN61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sh6AP8sT0f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YinL4tV8JY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C2QNpAt1yJ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:56.452Z"}